", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして。あなたの絵がとても好きで、私のOCのために一枚お願いしたいのです。\n\n彼女は騎士ですが、カタナを使い、勇ましく、優雅です。\n\n変更等ありましたら、お気軽にお申し付けください。この度はありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/XSl0A2k", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@koup_q/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/52b168d5/uploads/origins/2dcbad8d-c72c-428a-a948-78f63ceeecd3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6d518d07430dc740e38cae7b9ad6cb9e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/52b168d5/uploads/origins/2dcbad8d-c72c-428a-a948-78f63ceeecd3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6d518d07430dc740e38cae7b9ad6cb9e, https://si.imgix.net/52b168d5/uploads/origins/2dcbad8d-c72c-428a-a948-78f63ceeecd3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=5ea51f06bac345ebc07e4005106a6efa 2x, https://si.imgix.net/52b168d5/uploads/origins/2dcbad8d-c72c-428a-a948-78f63ceeecd3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=09d15c30629aeedcf4c9897aef9a3c90 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@koup_q/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/240542c1/uploads/origins/22721b5d-267c-4c42-a260-245b1ea7c2ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=227f49a3d5b61b2313e85dc4a750154f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/240542c1/uploads/origins/22721b5d-267c-4c42-a260-245b1ea7c2ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=227f49a3d5b61b2313e85dc4a750154f, https://si.imgix.net/240542c1/uploads/origins/22721b5d-267c-4c42-a260-245b1ea7c2ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0edad6aa954c715e63bac37f98eec469 2x, https://si.imgix.net/240542c1/uploads/origins/22721b5d-267c-4c42-a260-245b1ea7c2ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=497fa423fc696fd19a42d9ec12483b2f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "嘴広コウ先生初めまして。\n私、旅商人をしながら個人でVtuberをしているシャハラムと申します。\n姿などはお手数ですがTwitterのページをご覧いただければと思います。\n(https://twitter.com/shahramVT)\n\n嘴広コウ先生の素敵なイラストを以前から拝見させていただいておりまして、特にキャラの顔の描き方や色味などが大変好きです。\n今回は是非ご依頼をさせていただきたくリクエストを送らせていただきました。\n\nイラスト概要\n(夜みる方の)夢を込めた宝石を販売しているので、可能であれば宝石を織り交ぜて描いて頂けると大変嬉しいです。\n\n使用用途\nVtuberとしての活動の範囲(配信や告知など)で使用させていただきます。\n\nお忙しいところ恐縮ですが、ご検討のほどよろしくお願いいたします。\n※三面図などは私のTwitterから見れますが、高画質な立ち絵はママ様の方から見られるので年の為URL記載させていただきます。\n\nhttps://twitter.com/Hk_Nemo/status/1396475106268835845\n\nhttps://twitter.com/shahramVT/status/1560252330888400897?s=20&t=NlAlaWXU46c7AbbEVeRpYA", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@koup_q/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ec9c1f85/uploads/origins/333a088c-654a-4fc9-a5f9-c94feec3557c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a73c3a2d3c3dc3b1017f4ea661952b3e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ec9c1f85/uploads/origins/333a088c-654a-4fc9-a5f9-c94feec3557c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a73c3a2d3c3dc3b1017f4ea661952b3e, https://si.imgix.net/ec9c1f85/uploads/origins/333a088c-654a-4fc9-a5f9-c94feec3557c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=fd2a75e354a114880a5e56498779c7ec 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ec9c1f85/uploads/origins/333a088c-654a-4fc9-a5f9-c94feec3557c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3a0c5367d702a03c459f35a1a2e061a8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@koup_q/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4c8e6cf6/uploads/origins/b97f67ec-8921-4d6f-a426-0cab70dd3109?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dda2be00e38f00b221f570c35e4f43e9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4c8e6cf6/uploads/origins/b97f67ec-8921-4d6f-a426-0cab70dd3109?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dda2be00e38f00b221f570c35e4f43e9, https://si.imgix.net/4c8e6cf6/uploads/origins/b97f67ec-8921-4d6f-a426-0cab70dd3109?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7b2aba08ec827a6ada97e935192991b6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4c8e6cf6/uploads/origins/b97f67ec-8921-4d6f-a426-0cab70dd3109?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=840e8674fee33f110eba2218f1ef930c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi sensei! I would like to request a illustration of these two kids: https://sta.sh/211nrtsg7rj1?edit=1\n\nArc: An orphan who survived by using trickery and lies. He is always smiling— a habit he picked up. Arc tries to stay neutral, never loyal to anyone and never belonging to anyone. He is an information broker who recently became allies with Imille’s gang.\n\nImille: Fiercely loyal but also temperamental. Imille can be rash but she is quick and strong. She is like a street punk and delinquent. Imille is vain and likes to pick fights with others. She can be competitive. \n\nThe two have crossed paths before. Imille does not trust Arc because of this. Imille is suspicious of his intentions while Arc enjoys provoking her with a smile. Even though their relationship is not good, they eventually become partners and somewhat friends.\n\nInteraction: I would like Arc to be helping Imille! He can be tending to her injured leg or carrying her. Imille is not happy.\n\nhttps://sta.sh/211nrtsg7rj1?edit=1", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@koup_q/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e5581c9a/uploads/origins/3544238d-6405-4aca-af0e-7d60711c36fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=05ca41a1de5573d7693ca1adbc03c4d3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e5581c9a/uploads/origins/3544238d-6405-4aca-af0e-7d60711c36fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=05ca41a1de5573d7693ca1adbc03c4d3, https://si.imgix.net/e5581c9a/uploads/origins/3544238d-6405-4aca-af0e-7d60711c36fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3d31dca12153f5047bbd2f0f4dfbc7b6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e5581c9a/uploads/origins/3544238d-6405-4aca-af0e-7d60711c36fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fea04fda19581f4f0791cdf09b7ef708 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I love your style! May I request an illustration for my original characters, if possible? They are a couple. The pose is up to you.\n\nThe girl is active and mischievous, with a slightly darker color on the ears and the top side of the tail.\nThe male is an adult elf with a cold personality and short elf ears. He is strong and reliable. He does not show his emotions very much, but their relationship is very good. He always took care of her and he generally indulges her. His hair is a gradation of white to light blue. There is no need to draw armor or weapons.\n\nThey are adventures. There are a few costume designs, feel free to choose the one you like between image \"衣装01\"/03/05/06! \n\"衣装05\" is when the girl turns into a child. \n\nIf possible, please separate the signature into a different layer, thanks so much!\nThanks again for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1hElIblSGYEBRuWEN8oq0dpdD1Ue327Ix?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@koup_q/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/91da186e/uploads/origins/21b51190-be11-4951-912d-0eb9b25c505e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4a98406603a89baccbe6aea0f7eb552a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/91da186e/uploads/origins/21b51190-be11-4951-912d-0eb9b25c505e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4a98406603a89baccbe6aea0f7eb552a, https://si.imgix.net/91da186e/uploads/origins/21b51190-be11-4951-912d-0eb9b25c505e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=54a342133e50733b35367aaa49c25f4a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/91da186e/uploads/origins/21b51190-be11-4951-912d-0eb9b25c505e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=579261d811aec37b3ae96b6f8ab464c5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I really like your Illustrations! Can you draw an illustration of my two oc couple, Alfred (Blonde~28yo) and HanYu (Dark blue-22yo) together?\n\nHan Yu is the young king of a small kingdom and Alfred is the god of Justice and Punishment. Han Yu sometimes is a more active part of the couple, as the god Alfred doesn't reveal his facial expressions and emotions a lot and doesn't have the common sense of a human being. But if Alfred does show expressions would only be in front of Han Yu. Han Yu is kind, polite, and sometimes can be childish when alone with Alfred.\n\nPlease refer to the \"Western clothing.png\" for clothes in the link. You don't have to draw all of Alfred's wings. The pose can be anything, something interactive and cute as couple would be great! \n\nThank you so much!!:)\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1--8WHFlvSso7do3xQqxM6eN0zN4Wu-T0?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}